before pursuit of wonder was a youtube  channel it began as a book a book that  got turned down by publishers and  literary agents the inspiration for the  book was born out of the sense that so  many of us including myself feel as  though we have been given a carcass of  life of meaning in which important  aspects of how to potentially live  fulfilling authentic lives understand  the mind and the self introspect and  deal with the often disquieting  absurdity of it all are rarely if ever  truly addressed and discussed  i wanted to see more of these topics  engaged with in an enjoyable and  accessible way and i wanted to  contribute to this through pursuing and  sharing wonder through exploring  interesting and thought-provoking  philosophical ideas i was repeatedly  told however that without being a known  author or public figure that this  particular book would be a tough sell  and so since i couldn't get traditional  distribution and marketing i took the  issue of getting my work to the world  into my own hands  i took the manuscript of the book and  began creating videos out of it and then  started this youtube channel with those  videos  pursuit of wonder has now developed and  evolved into something that is beyond my  ability to even comprehend  in full circle under the pursuit of  wonder umbrella i have now begun writing  and publishing books and today i have  just released a brand new book that  essentially encapsulates the purpose and  vision of that original book that  catalyzed pursuit of wonder it is my  collected works of fully updated and  revised essays on various ideas and  schools of philosophy titled the art of  living a meaningless existence ideas  from philosophy that changed the way you  think which you can find the link to  purchase in the description below  [Music]  as soon as we gain self-consciousness  and an ability to inquire about the  world we are fated to ask questions like  how does the world work why does it work  this way what does it mean to be me to  be alive and how do i deal with these  questions and their seemingly  unanswerable nature  in more recent times a history-long  effort of constructing towers of meaning  with collective and religious  foundations have seemingly begun to fall  more and more  many of us are now left with a sense of  the individual need to construct our own  homes of meaning out of the debris  this of course is no easy task  however philosophy and literature have  helped provide me with a way to do so a  stack of blueprints and materials to  consider and build anew throughout  history and across the globe there are  thinkers and writers who have understood  and thought deeply about the underbelly  of existence they have and continued to  attempt to confront concerns thoughts  questions and doubts about life and its  meaning without the tiptoeing and  masquerading often found in other areas  of popular culture and self-development  i have found that the conversations i  have had with these individuals through  their books and art separated by time  and space of who most i have never and  can never meet have changed the way i  think in ways that have been essential  to the quality of my life  the art of living a meaningless  existence is an organized collection of  essays from the channel that journey  through philosophy in an attempt to  share these ideas and conversations  ideas that grapple with the complexities  of life and the increasingly relevant  problem of finding meaning and what  appears for many of us to be an  inherently meaningless existence  the book pulls from concepts in stoicism  existentialism nihilism absurdism  buddhism taoism and more attempting to  create accessible and thought-provoking  takeaways that change the way you think  about yourself existence and how to  appreciate the absurdity of it all not  only have the essays been improved and  revised but i have also added additional  essays containing deeper insights about  the overarching subjects and why i  personally find them valuable again if  you're interested the book is available  now through the links in the description  below it is currently available in both  paperback and ebook formats  pursuit of wonder started as a longing  to relentlessly pursue my curiosity  toward wonder and truth then it turned  into a sense of obligation to create the  most interesting and useful content i  could based on what i found and now it  has turned into a source of great  meaning for me  i hope you find something in my new work  or in my work more broadly that assist  you and your own process of discovery  just the same  if you do choose to grab a copy of the  book thank you sincerely in advance  regardless of whether you do thank you  sincerely for watching and for  supporting the channel and any and all  the ways you do your viewership your  subscribership your sharing of the  content your messages comments moments  of time and thought and all the rest i  truly appreciate it all  into the future i hope to continue to  create and build on this channel while  also beginning to more frequently create  and release other forms of media and  longer forms of work like books digital  downloads and whatever else the world  has in store  all your viewership purchasing of my  work and support in general help  contribute to the realization of these  goals and the evolution of the pursuit  of wonder and so again as always thank  you so much for watching in general and  see you next video
 

